Capability: Interactive Single-Page Web UI & REST API Server
  Rule: For ANY user-facing feature on the todo list, display an interactive Web UI dashboard with live tag pills, urgency heat badges, and a confirmation modal for destructive actions.

  Scenario: User manages tasks through the browser Web UI
    Given the Todo Web UI server is running on localhost
    When the user opens the todo board in a browser
    Then they can add tasks with #tags and recurrence, filter by tag or search query, toggle completion, and trigger 1-click GDPR JSON export & erasure
